# Chains of Mephistopheles and Notion Thief, both Bot1's, both replace each of Bot2's Ancestral Recall draws, and Bot2, the
# drawing player, chooses (CR 616.1). Bot2 has Notion Thief apply first each time: it skips the draw, and Bot1 draws instead.
# That draw is part of what replaced Bot2's, but Chains has not had its opportunity at it yet (CR 614.5), and it is a draw of
# Bot1's outside Bot1's draw step: Bot1 discards a card (the Forest, then the Islands it draws) and draws one. Bot1 ends
# with one card, having discarded three; Bot2 discards nothing and draws nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Chains of Mephistopheles
Notion Thief
Forest
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ancestral Recall
Swamp x5
Swamp x20

